TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Bilirsin, son zamanlarda {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0100}}
merakım tuttu.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}O yüzden elimde fazlasıyla
var, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Anyway, thank you, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
How about you take this with
you for all your trouble?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}En fin, gracias, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¿Por qué no te quedas con esto?
Por las molestias.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Danke jedenfalls, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Wieso nimmst du nicht dies hier
als Zeichen meiner Dankbarkeit?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Neyse, teşekkür ederim, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bunca zahmetine karşılık bunu yanında
götürmeye ne dersin?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ti darò qualcosina per abbellire
casa tua.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
È {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0100}}!
